   "text": "Thank you, Priya. Your identity is verified.\n\nI found order O-5103 from Green Bowl, delivered today at 6:31 PM. The tofu wrap (1 x $11.25) is listed on the order, so I can compensate you for it. You have two options:\n\n1. **Refund of $11.25** to your original payment method (Visa ending 4242).\n2. **Account credit of $13.50** (the item price plus 20%), usable on future orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
