   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, Priya! Before I pick one, I should mention the two lemonades were missing too. I ordered two, and neither one came.\n\nAccount credit would work better for me, since I order from Forkful almost every week. Is there a way to cover the lemonades as well?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I can cover the lemonades too. Here's the breakdown for the two missing items, with account credit for both:\n\n- **Tofu wrap:** 1 x $11.25, plus 20% = **$13.50** in credit\n- **Lemonade:** 2 x $4.00 = $8.00, plus 20% = **$9.60** in credit\n\nThat's **$23.10** in account credit total. The harvest bowls aren't part of the claim, so they aren't included.\n\nShould I apply the $23.10 credit to your account for these two items?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Yes, that works for me. Thanks for covering both the wrap and the lemonades. Please go ahead and apply the $23.10 credit to my account."
